{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/b8bb79f011763376e8bd46a818243947.poster.avif?t=1764863333\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/b8bb79f011763376e8bd46a818243947.webm?t=1764863333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/b8bb79f011763376e8bd46a818243947.mp4?t=1764863333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a heartfelt narrative road trip game where two companions share a car, conversations, and the fading light of day. In this choice-based adventure, every glance, silence, and detour shapes an intimate story of connection and reflection. Slow down, uncover unspoken emotions, and discover how small moments linger long after the journey ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gentle, <i>atmospheric indie game</i> that invites you to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk or Stay Silent:</strong> Engage in meaningful dialogues or embrace quiet pauses that reveal deeper layers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Small Choices:</strong> Decide on detours, topics, and paths that lead to <i>multiple endings</i> and branching narratives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Reflect:</strong> Notice the little things, memories, missed turns, and shared glances in a relaxing, <i>emotional story</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay for New Paths:</strong> Drive again to uncover alternate outcomes and hidden discoveries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/3c59d632e2c862578417b5bcc5bd3284.poster.avif?t=1764863333\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/3c59d632e2c862578417b5bcc5bd3284.webm?t=1764863333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/3c59d632e2c862578417b5bcc5bd3284.mp4?t=1764863333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the trip ends, you can look back on where you\u2019ve been or take the drive again, and see where a different path might lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of story-rich games, Sunset Drive offers a short, replayable experience with beautiful visuals and a calming soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports English and Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The road is yours, will you take the scenic route? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover more with DLC: Original Soundtrack and Art Collections in the Deluxe Edition.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hit the road!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/11278cc9c3afe5278d4a6622d966d16940a42e47.jpg"},{"name":"Dawn, it's beautiful!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/b979e2a878b847783645d0cd8a6b175de7aacb43.jpg"},{"name":"Hello, sunshine!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/f57aca33ebe412781237f62fbfec38ea1312f780.jpg"},{"name":"Solemn luxury","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/3612078876bd990662ac4ae956efb250fd93e5d4.jpg"},{"name":"Sorry, I'm latte!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/da0f139f2013598a57e2d699cad651e56e1e0bd4.jpg"},{"name":"Man of the woods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/84817860b4792d00f9a021ac2e9496c8b53d6e52.jpg"},{"name":"Peaceful pieces","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/5dba2e50c407d76b9bc4f5a3a933e65ad06b42e2.jpg"},{"name":"Red as strawberry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/01e1efc14a52a2e9a0ac7b617d15ba8e8bf2b0ff.jpg"},{"name":"By the she-shore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/bf2fb9c8ad8e16ba4d8a4eef012b0b20206f1651.jpg"},{"name":"Gone in 60 seconds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609990/8e80d73cabce68e37c8416142de53ea50d5a43ba.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609990?t=1764863333","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/463226ac4a1d8539699e1827f745ab572f44057e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764863333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/566035c23ce9b8f7a68237ae88b3fe78a05febe6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764863333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/566035c23ce9b8f7a68237ae88b3fe78a05febe6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764863333","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/a838cbb9ef63864aad8a0df713434b91.avif?t=1764863333\" width=616 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take <i>Sunset Drive</i> with you beyond the screen. In addition to the base game, you will also get the high-resolution, print-ready artworks and full-length soundtracks designed to bring the game\u2019s calm, reflective atmosphere into your everyday life.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/b8bb79f011763376e8bd46a818243947.poster.avif?t=1764863333\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/b8bb79f011763376e8bd46a818243947.webm?t=1764863333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/b8bb79f011763376e8bd46a818243947.mp4?t=1764863333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a heartfelt narrative road trip game where two companions share a car, conversations, and the fading light of day. In this choice-based adventure, every glance, silence, and detour shapes an intimate story of connection and reflection. Slow down, uncover unspoken emotions, and discover how small moments linger long after the journey ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gentle, <i>atmospheric indie game</i> that invites you to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk or Stay Silent:</strong> Engage in meaningful dialogues or embrace quiet pauses that reveal deeper layers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Small Choices:</strong> Decide on detours, topics, and paths that lead to <i>multiple endings</i> and branching narratives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Reflect:</strong> Notice the little things, memories, missed turns, and shared glances in a relaxing, <i>emotional story</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay for New Paths:</strong> Drive again to uncover alternate outcomes and hidden discoveries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/3c59d632e2c862578417b5bcc5bd3284.poster.avif?t=1764863333\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/3c59d632e2c862578417b5bcc5bd3284.webm?t=1764863333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/extras/3c59d632e2c862578417b5bcc5bd3284.mp4?t=1764863333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the trip ends, you can look back on where you\u2019ve been or take the drive again, and see where a different path might lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of story-rich games, Sunset Drive offers a short, replayable experience with beautiful visuals and a calming soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports English and Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The road is yours, will you take the scenic route? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover more with DLC: Original Soundtrack and Art Collections in the Deluxe Edition.</p>","developers":["Klapanom Games"],"dlc":[3647260,3647250],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609990/d72094bc1736163a31a75aaec8b6652913b947d2/header.jpg?t=1764863333","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Klapanom Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u